      "id": "sol.ahsme-1959-p5.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Using the product rule for powers, \\[ \\begin{aligned} 256^{0.16}\\cdot256^{0.09} &=256^{0.25}\\\\ &=256^{\\frac{1}{4}}=4. \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is A.",
